        "text": "string | number | {\n\t\t\t/**\n\t\t\t * A code or identifier for this diagnostic.\n\t\t\t * Should be used for later processing, e.g. when providing {@link CodeActionContext code actions}.\n\t\t\t */\n\t\t\tvalue: string | number;\n\n\t\t\t/**\n\t\t\t * A target URI to open with more information about the diagnostic error.\n\t\t\t */\n\t\t\ttarget: Uri;\n\t\t}",
